### ===================================
### Flow (Flowable) API Tests
### Base Path: /api/flow
### Note: Flowable is disabled in dev profile
### ===================================

### Start Process Instance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flow/process
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processDefinitionKey": "simple-process",
  "variables": {
    "initiator": "admin",
    "description": "Test process instance"
  }
}

###

### Get Tasks by Assignee
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flow/tasks?assignee=admin

###

### Complete Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/flow/tasks/task-123/complete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "variables": {
    "approved": true,
    "comments": "Approved by admin"
  }
}

###

### Get Tasks for Process
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/flow/process/process-123/tasks
